WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Drive Impact splats Ryu against the corner after he blocks.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.950
Chun-Li uses raw Drive Rush after the wall splat.

3
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.750
Rush crouching heavy punch starts the juggle.

4
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.700
Heavy Hundred Lightning Kicks keeps Ryu airborne.

5
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.000
A second raw Drive Rush follows the first Legs.

6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.850
Rush crouching medium punch catches Ryu.

7
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.350
Heavy Legs continues the corner juggle.

8
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.550
Heavy Tensho Kicks adds the final hits.

9
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:09.650
Ryu recovers beside the wall.
